            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uzupełnij funkcję strzałkową tak, aby <code>total</code> przechowywało sumę wartości tablicy <code>prices</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prices = [\" /><text value=\"17.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24.75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8.50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = prices.reduce(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"118\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"84.5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>+ currVal</code>.</p></body></html>"
